        },
        {
          "text": "Ni murābe ibiguruka vyo mu kirēre, ntibibiba, ntibishwabura, kandi ntivyimburira mu bigega, ariko So wo mw ijuru arabitunga; mbega mwebge ntimubiruta cane? ",
